# Melek, Reforged Researcher (*/*): "Melek's power and toughness are each equal to twice the number of instant and sorcery cards in
# your graveyard" - a characteristic-defining ability (CR 604.3, layer 7a). Turn 1: Bot1 pays a Black Lotus for a Lightning Bolt at
# Bot2 and casts Melek with the rest; the graveyard holds the Lotus (an artifact, not counted) and the Bolt, so Melek is 2/2. Turn 2:
# Bot2 bolts Bot1's face; that Bolt goes to Bot2's graveyard, which is not Bot1's, so Melek stays 2/2. Turn 3: Bot1 bolts Bot2 again
# (4/4), and on turn 5 casts Think Twice (a third instant, 6/6).

